# AI Tools
#
# AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md and .mcp.json are tracked deliberately (D16). They carry this
# project's conventions and the pointer to the Boost MCP server, so a contributor's
# agent starts with the same rules rather than guessing. Regenerate with
# `php artisan boost:update`.
#
# Everything below is either per-developer editor state or Boost-owned content that
# `php artisan boost:install --skills` reproduces identically.
.claude/
.cursor/
.idea/
.junie/
.vscode/
.agents/
.codex/
boost.json
opencode.json
.github/skills/
/tmp

